<task id="023" project="spaarkeai-mcp-bff-api-r2">
  <metadata>
    <title>Document tools: spaarke_list_documents, spaarke_get_document</title>
    <phase>1 Read tools</phase>
    <gate>r1 gate RELEASED 2026-11-25 (joint mcp-r1/mcp-r2 determination under the owner's delegation; see notes/decisions.md D-r1-gate). Before starting, merge origin/master into this branch (merge, never rebase). Do not edit r1's ISS-010 files (DecisionCommitService, Actions/DecisionActionExecutors, RecordCreationService, CallerWriteAuthorization, CallerRecordAccessProbe, CallerMetadataReadMemo, AssignTaskNotifier, the email-bell job handler) or the Decision wizard heading files (DecisionWizard/steps/FoundStep.tsx, Worklist/IssueLine.tsx, composeIssueLine.ts) without messaging mcp-r1 first.</gate>
    <status>in-progress</status>
    <rigor>FULL</rigor>
    <rigor-reason>New BFF surface (two MCP tools) over document access; adds uniform not-found tests</rigor-reason>
    <model-tier>sonnet</model-tier>
    <model-tier-reason>Thin adapters copying CompleteDecisionTool over existing document list and file-access logic</model-tier-reason>
    <effort>high</effort>
    <parallel-group>F</parallel-group>
    <parallel-safe>true</parallel-safe>
    <parallel-reason>Owns Api/Mcp/LegalOperations/Documents/**, the Documents ledger partial and its tests</parallel-reason>
    <deps>020</deps>
    <tags>bff-api, api, integration-test</tags>
    <estimated-effort>4-5 hours</estimated-effort>
  </metadata>

  <prompt>Add two read-only MCP tools: spaarke_list_documents with the GET /api/v1/documents logic (filters such as regarding matter), and spaarke_get_document returning metadata plus preview and open links from the FileAccessEndpoints logic (/api/documents/{id}/preview-url, /open-links). Both run as the caller; a document the caller cannot read returns a uniform not-found.</prompt>
  <role>SPAARKE platform developer. Follow ADRs strictly. Expert in MCP tool handlers and SharePoint Embedded document access.</role>
  <goal>Both tools match REST for an allowed document, return a uniform not-found for a forbidden or missing one, and serve as the data source for task 011's attachment picker (list by regarding matter).</goal>

  <context>
    <background>Spec FR-03, NFR-02, NFR-07. REST: Api/DataverseDocumentsEndpoints.cs (group /api/v1/documents, GET "/" ListDocumentsAsync :622, GET "/{id}" :38); Api/FileAccessEndpoints.cs (group /api/documents; preview-url :65, open-links :111, view-url :122). IDocumentDataverseService is in src/server/shared/Spaarke.Dataverse/. If list/get logic lives inline in the endpoint lambdas, extract it to a method both the route and the tool call (no copy), with a frozen-bytes contract test first.</background>
    <relevant-files>
      <file role="new">src/server/api/Sprk.Bff.Api/Api/Mcp/LegalOperations/Documents/ListDocumentsTool.cs</file>
      <file role="new">src/server/api/Sprk.Bff.Api/Api/Mcp/LegalOperations/Documents/GetDocumentTool.cs</file>
      <file role="modify">src/server/api/Sprk.Bff.Api/Api/DataverseDocumentsEndpoints.cs (only if list/get logic must be extracted from a lambda)</file>
      <file role="modify">tests/Spaarke.ArchTests/RouteAuthorizationGuardTests.Mcp.Documents.cs</file>
      <file role="new">tests/integration/contract/Api/Mcp/Documents/DocumentToolsContractTests.cs</file>
      <file role="new">tests/integration/auth/Mcp/Documents/DocumentToolsNotFoundTests.cs</file>
      <file role="canonical-reference">src/server/api/Sprk.Bff.Api/Api/Mcp/LegalOperations/Decisions/CompleteDecisionTool.cs</file>
      <file role="canonical-reference">src/server/api/Sprk.Bff.Api/Api/FileAccessEndpoints.cs</file>
      <file role="canonical-reference">tests/integration/contract/Api/Signals/SignalRoutesContractBaselineTests.cs (frozen bytes, if an extraction is needed)</file>
    </relevant-files>
    <dependencies>
      <dependency task="020" status="pending">General McpToolResults, ledger partials</dependency>
    </dependencies>
  </context>

  <constraints>
    <constraint source="project">r1 gate RELEASED 2026-11-25 (joint mcp-r1/mcp-r2 determination under the owner's delegation; see notes/decisions.md D-r1-gate). Before starting, merge origin/master into this branch (merge, never rebase). Do not edit r1's ISS-010 files (DecisionCommitService, Actions/DecisionActionExecutors, RecordCreationService, CallerWriteAuthorization, CallerRecordAccessProbe, CallerMetadataReadMemo, AssignTaskNotifier, the email-bell job handler) or the Decision wizard heading files (DecisionWizard/steps/FoundStep.tsx, Worklist/IssueLine.tsx, composeIssueLine.ts) without messaging mcp-r1 first.</constraint>
    <constraint source="ADR-028">Run as the caller (IHttpContextAccessor; UserContextRequired; no app-only fallback; never pass or log the token). Use the same authorization the REST routes apply; a forbidden and a missing document both return the same isError not-found result (reasonCode and message identical).</constraint>
    <constraint source="project">Each tool: [McpArea("legal-operations")], readOnlyHint true, destructiveHint false, idempotentHint true, a title, "use for / not for" description ≤ 1,024 characters. Ledger rows in RouteAuthorizationGuardTests.Mcp.Documents.cs.</constraint>
    <constraint source="project">If an extraction from DataverseDocumentsEndpoints is needed, write the frozen-bytes contract test for the REST route before the refactor; REST response bytes stay unchanged.</constraint>
    <constraint source="ADR-015">Model-visible: id, name, file type, size, modified date, regarding matter name, preview/open links; no document content and no secured fields. Logs: tool name, latency, row count, outcome, correlation id only. Result &lt; 64 KiB at the list maximum.</constraint>
    <constraint source="ADR-029">Every change this task makes under src/server/api/Sprk.Bff.Api/ is listed in the PR with a Placement Justification that cites .claude/constraints/bff-extensions.md (source: spec.md 'Placement &amp; New Components'), and the PR records the publish-size delta against a fresh master build per .claude/constraints/azure-deployment.md 'BFF Publish-Size Per-Task Verification Rule': +5 MB or more needs explicit justification, 55 MB total triggers architecture review, 60 MB is a hard stop. No new HIGH CVE (dotnet list package --vulnerable --include-transitive).</constraint>
    <constraint source="ADR-038">Every test this task adds lives on a KEEP path (tests/integration/{auth,contract,regression,data-mutation}/** or tests/unit/domain/**), mocks only at module boundaries, and uses no Mock&lt;HttpMessageHandler&gt; or Mock&lt;IServiceClient&gt;.</constraint>
    <constraint source="project">Before each push run bash scripts/quality/check-changed-cs-format.sh origin/master. CS0618 is a build error: migrate, never suppress.</constraint>
  </constraints>

